and I don't feel like I
have to do the same thing

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:43.775
over and over.

00:10:43.775 --> 00:10:46.083
I think if you're a creative person

00:10:46.083 --> 00:10:48.283
then you kind of just
have to follow your vibe.

00:10:48.283 --> 00:10:50.574
If an opportunity is there for somebody

00:10:50.574 --> 00:10:54.220
something interesting you know sparks me

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.747
then you can go for it.

00:10:55.747 --> 00:10:59.214
And I was just kind of
never one of those people

00:10:59.214 --> 00:11:01.202
that felt like I couldn't do it.

00:11:01.202 --> 00:11:03.152
I've got the right people
around me to I believe

00:11:03.152 --> 00:11:04.821
to join anything I want to do.

00:11:04.821 --> 00:11:06.938
- Well you do, in everything you've done.

00:11:06.938 --> 00:11:09.719
- I don't master at all but
I persevered through it all

00:11:09.719 --> 00:11:12.922
and it gives me a chance to
find the next thing to work on.

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:14.943
So I'm a fighter you know I

00:11:14.943 --> 00:11:18.352
I know how to take them as
much as I've been give them.

00:11:18.352 --> 00:11:22.558
- So so when I for some
reason felt that I had

00:11:22.558 --> 00:11:25.699
this small bit of confidence to audition

00:11:25.699 --> 00:11:27.003
for the drill team.

00:11:27.003 --> 00:11:29.065
And I made sure I was
auditioning for captain

00:11:29.065 --> 00:11:30.871
not just to be a part of the team

00:11:30.871 --> 00:11:33.720
which is not that was not
something that I normally

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:34.716
did in my life.

00:11:34.716 --> 00:11:36.743
Like step outside of my
comfort zone and do something

00:11:36.743 --> 00:11:40.324
where I was being put
out in front of people.

00:11:40.324 --> 00:11:43.519
But I auditioned and they made me captain

00:11:43.519 --> 00:11:46.328
and the drill team coach Elizabeth Camtine

00:11:46.328 --> 00:11:48.509
saw something in me immediately.

00:11:48.509 --> 00:11:53.064
She saw an ability that
I had my body proportions

00:11:53.064 --> 00:11:55.425
and she thought, you are a ballerina

00:11:55.425 --> 00:11:57.885
and I want to introduce
you to someone who's giving

00:11:57.885 --> 00:12:00.215
a free ballet class at
the Boys and Girls Club

00:12:00.215 --> 00:12:01.706
that she already attends.

00:12:01.706 --> 00:12:05.499
So I was not at all interested in ballet.

00:12:05.499 --> 00:12:09.460
But after about a week of
hiding out in the back of this

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.085
ballet class on the basketball court

00:12:12.085 --> 00:12:15.155
the teacher Cynthia
Bradley pulled me on and

00:12:15.155 --> 00:12:17.718
I took my first class in socks and

00:12:17.718 --> 00:12:19.087
shorts and a T-shirt.

